# EXPRESS-014 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:14  (starts with notes n1 … n4)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Admin (expect 200 { "totalNotes": 4, "private": 2, "team": 2, "byOwner": { "u-alice": 2, "u-bob": 2 } })
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer token-root

### Member (expect 403)
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer token-alice

### No token (expect 401, already handled by the starter)
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
